nfig":{"label":{"$i18n":"common.save"},"size":"sm","variant":"primary"},"id":"refs-save","type":"Button"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"RootShell"},"name":"Spec editor","spec":{"accessibility":["Each text area of a list is named \"Item n\" and each remove button names the item it removes; the intent field is named by its section title.","An error is a sentence under its field and the first problem takes focus, never color alone.","A conflict and a refused save are announced as alerts."],"constraints":["Built only from Adapter Widgets (Stack, Text, Icon, Badge, Button, TextInput, Select, Alert, SegmentedControl, Segment); no Widget outside the Adapter catalog.","The Spec has no \"unsaved changes\" indicator in the app, so none is modelled: an edited draft looks like an untouched one until it is saved or cancelled; a conflict or a refusal is the only feedback.","The form is shown scrolled to the section being edited, without the sections above it; the Select of a reference does not open a View list here, and the View of a reference is the label a Variant sets.","The sample item texts, the comparison text, the lock holder and the diagnostic paths are sample content; text fields hold baked samples under panel.sample.*.","Focus placement, the Cmd+Enter and Escape keys, the toast \"Spec saved.\" and the disabled look of fields while saving are not modelled.","Every visible string is bound with $i18n except identities (paths, Widget ids, URLs, Variant names); en-US and zh-TW keep identical key sets.","Visual language follows the Quiet Canvas design system in DESIGN.md."],"decisions":[],"entryConditions":["A member who may write Views pressed the pencil of one section of the Spec tab on a desktop layout (the panel scrolls the form into view); only one section is edited at a time.","The base state is the Interaction rules (§3) of the View Checkout with three items, nothing changed yet; Variants edit the intent (§1) or the references (§7).","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme; a tablet and a phone read the Spec and never open this form."],"intent":"Show the editing of one section of a View's Spec as built from Adapter Widgets only: the section form (a text area for the intent, a list of items for entry conditions, interaction rules, constraints and accessibility, rows of type, address and relation for the references), its Cancel and Save, and what a save that was refused says: a conflict with a comparison, a lease held by someone else, or fields the server found invalid.","interactionRules":["The form is the section's content as drafted: the intent in one text area, each item of a list in its own text area with a remove button and Add item, each reference with its type (Link or View), its address or View, a label or Variant, and a relation; empty items are dropped on save.","Cancel closes the form and drops the draft; Save writes the section only, against the revision read when editing started, and says \"Saving…\" while it runs; Decisions and the other sections are kept as read.","A reference that is not an absolute URL, or a View reference without a View, shows its message under its field and nothing is saved.","After a revision conflict nothing is resent: the draft is kept and the Spec says it changed; Compare versions shows the draft beside the saved section, Discard mine drops the draft, and Keep editing mine continues from the saved version so the next save replaces that section.","While another member holds the View's edit lease Save waits, and a save the server refuses for the lease keeps the draft and says who holds the lease until when; fields the server found invalid are listed with their path under \"The Spec wasn't saved\"."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"},{"relation":"opened-from","type":"view","viewId":"b1c7e303-4a1d-4c2e-9f31-7a4c0d2e6b03"},{"relation":"sibling","type":"view","viewId":"b1c7e304-4a1d-4c2e-9f31-7a4c0d2e6b04"},{"relation":"opened-from","type":"view","viewId":"7f3d7780-3cb9-4e57-8f0b-2e8d569905c1"},{"relation":"sibling","type":"view","viewId":"b1c7e301-4a1d-4c2e-9f31-7a4c0d2e6b01"}],"requirements":["01a116f0-89b6-7d08-a850-e1ee1aecd51f"]},"variants":{"conflict":{"requirements":["01a11485-f451-72eb-81ad-686aeec7b3eb"],"state":{"conflict":{"visible":true},"rules-save":{"disabled":true}}},"conflict-comparing":{"requirements":["01a11485-f451-72eb-81ad-686aeec7b3eb"],"state":{"compare":{"visible":true},"conflict":{"visible":true},"conflict-compare":{"visible":false},"conflict-hide":{"visible":true},"rules-save":{"disabled":true}}},"conflict-loading-theirs":{"state":{"compare":{"visible":true},"compare-keep":{"visible":false},"compare-loading":{"visible":true},"compare-theirs-box":{"visible":false},"conflict":{"visible":true},"conflict-compare":{"visible":false},"conflict-hide":{"visible":true},"rules-save":{"disabled":true}}},"editing-intent":{"state":{"sec-intent":{"visible":true},"sec-rules":{"visible":false}}},"editing-references":{"state":{"sec-refs":{"visible":true},"sec-rules":{"visible":false}}},"invalid":{"state":{"invalid":{"visible":true}}},"lease-held":{"requirements":["01a11485-f118-764c-ab2b-1b54b4270625"],"state":{"rules-save":{"disabled":true}}},"locked":{"requirements":["01a11485-f118-764c-ab2b-1b54b4270625"],"state":{"locked-alert":{"visible":true},"rules-save":{"disabled":true}}},"references-field-errors":{"state":{"ref-1-uri":{"invalid":true,"value":"checkout-design"},"ref-2-view":{"invalid":true,"value":""},"ref-2-view-error":{"visible":true},"sec-refs":{"visible":true},"sec-rules":{"visible":false}}},"saving":{"state":{"rules-cancel":{"disabled":true},"rules-save":{"visible":false},"rules-saving":{"visible":true}}}}}
